Package: ledgerly
Version: @VERSION@
Section: office
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Ledgerly maintainers <ledgerly@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE_KB@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libx11-6, libgl1
Homepage: https://github.com/DevanshChoubey/tally-oss
Description: Accounting for Indian businesses and their accountants
 Ledgerly is a local-first desktop accounting application. The ledgerly-app
 program is the desktop app; the ledgerly command line checks audit chains,
 exports GST returns and serves the MCP server for AI clients.
